note for CvConfirmation "Exact canonical goal/selection/projection identity; no independent target store and no assessment claim."
note for ConfirmedRequirement "Generic eligibility/location constraints stay unresolved context; no forced qualification interpretation. Alternatives and full bounded evidence survive projection."
note for cv_conversations "Operational CV history, separate from factual evidence revisions. Manual-only history may have no CV reference."
note for ChatAction "Public responses exclude internal leases, execution snapshots and original mutation controls."

