note for InterviewMemory "Mongo-persistent. Transient provider context projects a compact per-source discussion summary, four recent messages and an answer ID/target/status index; exact answers hydrate only on recall. No summary model call or new stored facts. Relevant user review statements override CV/earlier facts; no evidence-alignment verifier. Source edits/re-extraction invalidate affected coverage; ordinary answers retain completed topics but invalidate estimates. Topics close on navigation or finish, never on a follow-up answer; progress does not measure mastery."

